OL,3,CWoman found not guilty of owning XL
OL,4,Cbully that fatally bit partner's father
OL,6,FA woman has been found not guilty of
OL,7,Fowning an XL bully dog that fatally
OL,8,Fbit a 62-year-old man - with one bite
OL,9,Fstrong enough to almost sever a major
OL,10,Fartery.
OL,12,FKeven Jones, from Chester, died in
OL,13,F2022 and his son's partner, Chanel
OL,14,FFong, 33, was accused of being the
OL,15,Fowner of the dog that bit him. She
OL,16,Fpleaded not guilty to two charges
OL,17,Funder the Dangerous Dogs Act and was
OL,18,Fcleared by a jury at Caernarfon Crown
OL,19,FCourt on Friday 14 August.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/6
