OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786799881
OL,3,CWoman found not guilty of owning XL
OL,4,Cbully that fatally bit partner's father
OL,6,FThe incident happened at a home on
OL,7,FHolt Road in Wrexham, where Mr Jones'
OL,8,Fson Joshua Jones, a dog breeder, lived
OL,9,Fwith his partner Chanel Fong. Only
OL,10,FMiss Fong was at home at the time of
OL,11,Fthe attack.
OL,13,FThe prosecution claimed that Miss
OL,14,FFong, who was present in the house but
OL,15,Faway from the garden where the attack
OL,16,Ftook place, "had become complacent,
OL,17,Fshe had failed to take the
OL,18,Fresponsibilities seriously enough of
OL,19,Fsuch a large and powerful dog".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
