PN,43603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786799881
OL,3,CWoman found not guilty of owning XL
OL,4,Cbully that fatally bit partner's father
OL,6,FPart of her defence was that Cookie,
OL,7,Fthe dog which made the fatal attack,
OL,8,Fwas actually owned by and registered
OL,9,Fto Joshua Jones.
OL,11,FThe defence also claimed "a tragic
OL,12,Fdeath does not equate with guilt".
OL,14,FThe court heard that Mr Jones offered
OL,15,Fto bring two XL bully type dogs in
OL,16,Ffrom the garden and into the living
OL,17,Froom. It was in that garden, whilst on
OL,18,Fhis own, that Cookie began to attack
OL,19,Fhim, biting him on the legs.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786799881
OL,3,CWoman found not guilty of owning XL
OL,4,Cbully that fatally bit partner's father
OL,6,FThe wounds inflicted were so bad that
OL,7,FMr Jones bled to death.
OL,9,FAt the time of the attack, XL bullies
OL,10,Fwere not a banned breed.
OL,12,FSumming up for the prosecution, Mark
OL,13,FConnor told the jury that Miss Fong
OL,14,Fhad failed to assist Keven Jones in
OL,15,Fbringing the dogs in when she was
OL,16,Faware the 62-year-old was "not a
OL,17,Fphysically robust enough individual to
OL,18,Fhandle this dog".
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
