FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786799881
OL,3,CWoman found not guilty of owning XL
OL,4,Cbully that fatally bit partner's father
OL,6,FHe added: "Mr Jones' injuries were
OL,7,Fhorrific - this dog was still mauling
OL,8,FMr Jones when Miss Fong came to his
OL,9,Faid."
OL,11,FDefence counsel Rebecca Filetti told
OL,12,Fthe jury that "this isn't a case that
OL,13,FChanel Fong should have foreseen what
OL,14,Fhappened - this is an issue of
OL,15,Fliability."
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
