FL,437,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786799881
OL,3,CWoman found not guilty of owning XL
OL,4,Cbully that fatally bit partner's father
OL,6,FShe added that the jury had to decide
OL,7,Fwhere responsibility lay and that
OL,8,F"just because this situation ended in
OL,9,Fan awful tragedy it does not end in
OL,10,FChanel Fong being criminally
OL,11,Fresponsible".
OL,13,FIt took the jury less than three hours
OL,14,Fto find Chanel Fong not guilty. Miss
OL,15,FFong wept as the verdict was read out.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/6
